<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Prior approval has been authorised by Specific Needs for the use of a forward facing car seat on your upcoming Qantas operated flight.<br />
<br />
Please note, final approval is given by staff at the airport upon sighting the car seat.<br />
<br />
Parent/guardian is responsible for fitting the seat and ensuring the infant/child is correctly positioned and that the restraint straps (including shoulder straps) are used in accordance with the manufacturer's instructions.<br />
<br />
Please be at the gate for pre-boarding to allow time for fitment of car seat.<br />
<br />
If any of your flights are operated by an airline other than Qantas, you must obtain approval for the car seat or child restraint system from that airline.</body>
